<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl" data-theme="night">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>خارطة الطريق التقنية التفاعلية — حازم الحسيني</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@600;700;800;900&family=IBM+Plex+Sans+Arabic:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --radius-xl: 28px;
    --radius-lg: 18px;
    --radius-md: 12px;
    --font-display: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
    --font-body: 'IBM Plex Sans Arabic', sans-serif;
    --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  }

  html[data-theme="night"] {
    --bg: #060913;
    --panel: rgba(18, 25, 41, 0.75);
    --panel-solid: #0d1322;
    --panel-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    --text: #f0f4fc;
    --muted: #94a3b8;
    --accent: #38bdf8;
    --accent-glow: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.35);
    --purple: #c084fc;
    --emerald: #34d399;
    --rose: #fb7185;
    --amber: #fbbf24;
    --cyan: #22d3ee;
    --orange: #fb923c;
    --pink: #e879f9;
    --term-bg: #050811;
    --term-text: #38bdf8;
    --shadow-d: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  }

  html[data-theme="day"] {
    --bg: #eef2f6;
    --panel: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    --panel-solid: #ffffff;
    --panel-border: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
    --line: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
    --text: #0f172a;
    --muted: #64748b;
    --accent: #0284c7;
    --accent-glow: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.25);
    --purple: #9333ea;
    --emerald: #059669;
    --rose: #e11d48;
    --amber: #d97706;
    --cyan: #0891b2;
    --orange: #ea580c;
    --pink: #c084fc;
    --term-bg: #0f172a;
    --term-text: #38bdf8;
    --shadow-d: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    line-height: 1.7;
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    position: relative;
    transition: background 0.4s ease, color 0.4s ease;
  }

  #webCanvas { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 1; pointer-events: auto; }

  .wrap { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; position: relative; z-index: 3; pointer-events: none; }
  .wrap * { pointer-events: auto; }
  code, .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono); }

  header.nav {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50;
    background: rgba(6, 9, 19, 0.65);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .nav-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 16px 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
  .back-link {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted);
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-weight: 600;
    transition: color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .back-link:hover { color: var(--accent); transform: translateX(4px); }

  .toggle {
    width: 56px; height: 30px; border-radius: 99px; cursor: pointer;
    background: var(--panel-solid); border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
    position: relative; padding: 3px; transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }
  .toggle .knob {
    width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent-glow);
    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
  }
  html[data-theme="day"] .toggle .knob { transform: translateX(-26px); }

  .hero { padding: 48px 0 20px; text-align: center; }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 1px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    background: var(--panel-solid); border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
    padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 99px; margin-bottom: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px var(--accent-glow);
  }
  .eyebrow .dot {
    width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent); animation: pulse-dot 2s infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse-dot { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); } 50% { opacity: 0.4; transform: scale(0.8); } }

  .hero h1 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.2; }
  .hero h1 span {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--purple));
    -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
  .hero p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; max-width: 65ch; margin: 0 auto; }

  .hint-badge {
    margin: 20px auto 4px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--accent);
    background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1); border: 1px dashed var(--accent);
    padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .path-row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 22px 0 6px; }
  .path-node {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.76rem; font-weight: 700;
    padding: 8px 15px; border-radius: 99px; background: var(--panel-solid);
    border: 1px solid var(--panel-border); cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
  }
  .path-node:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }

  main { padding: 20px 0 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; perspective: 1000px; }

  .hud {
    background: var(--panel);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px var(--shadow-d);
  }

  .track {
    padding: 28px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    opacity: 0; transform: translateY(28px);
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }
  .track.reveal { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  .track::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; width: 100%; height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--tcolor), transparent); opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .track-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .track-icon {
    width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); flex: none;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 24px;
    background: var(--panel-solid); border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }
  .track:hover .track-icon { transform: scale(1.08) rotate(-4deg); }
  .track-titles h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .track-titles .sub { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .track-badge {
    margin-inline-start: auto; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 800;
    padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 99px; color: #fff; background: var(--tcolor);
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--tcolor);
  }

  .topic-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }

  .topic-card {
    background: var(--panel-solid); border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
    padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;
  }
  .topic-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.02); border-color: var(--tcolor); box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); }
  .topic-info { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .topic-num {
    width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center;
    justify-content: center; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 0.82rem; color: #fff; background: var(--tcolor); flex: none;
  }
  .topic-title { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); }
  .topic-title .en { display: block; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500; }
  .click-icon { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--muted); transition: transform 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease; }
  .topic-card:hover .click-icon { color: var(--tcolor); transform: translateX(-4px); }

  .fw-container { background: var(--panel-solid); border: 1px solid var(--panel-border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .fw-controls { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
  .fw-status { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .btn-sim {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700;
    padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 8px; border: none; cursor: pointer;
    background: var(--rose); color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.4);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }
  .btn-sim:hover { transform: scale(1.05); }
  .btn-sim:disabled { opacity: 0.6; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none; }
  .fw-visual { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; position: relative; padding: 20px 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border-radius: var(--radius-md); }
  .fw-node { text-align: center; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; width: 90px; flex: none; }
  .fw-node span { font-size: 28px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .fw-lane { position: relative; flex: 1; height: 40px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .fw-lane::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; top: 50%; height: 2px; background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--line) 0 8px, transparent 8px 16px); }
  .fw-shield {
    position: absolute; right: 50%; transform: translateX(50%); z-index: 5;
    width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--panel-solid);
    border: 2px solid var(--rose); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 20px; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.5); transition: box-shadow .3s ease;
  }
  .fw-shield.under-attack { animation: shieldPulse .5s ease-in-out infinite; box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(251,113,133,.9); }
  @keyframes shieldPulse{ 0%,100%{ transform:translateX(50%) scale(1); } 50%{ transform:translateX(50%) scale(1.08); } }
  .fw-packet { position: absolute; right: 0; width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; transition: right 1.2s linear, opacity 0.3s ease; }
  .fw-packet.allow { background: var(--emerald); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--emerald); }
  .fw-packet.block { background: var(--rose); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--rose); }

  .drawer-overlay {
    position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    z-index: 100; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }
  .drawer-overlay.active { opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }

  .drawer {
    position: fixed; top: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; max-width: 520px;
    background: var(--panel-solid); border-inline-end: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
    z-index: 101; transform: translateX(-100%); transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-shadow: -20px 0 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }
  .drawer.active { transform: translateX(0); }

  .drawer-header { padding: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; }
  .drawer-badge { display: inline-block; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .drawer-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.3; }
  .drawer-subtitle { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .drawer-close {
    width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
    background: var(--panel); color: var(--text); font-size: 1.2rem; cursor: pointer;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: all 0.2s ease; flex: none;
  }
  .drawer-close:hover { background: var(--rose); color: #fff; border-color: var(--rose); }

  .drawer-body { padding: 24px; overflow-y: auto; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
  .drawer-section { background: var(--panel); padding: 18px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .drawer-section-title { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 700; }
  .drawer-text { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.7; }
  .drawer-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; margin-top: 8px; }
  .drawer-list li { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--muted); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .drawer-list li::before { content: '▹'; color: var(--accent); font-family: var(--font-mono); }

  .terminal-box {
    background: var(--term-bg); border: 1px solid var(--panel-border); border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 16px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--term-text);
    position: relative; overflow-x: auto; direction: ltr; text-align: left;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }
  .terminal-header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
  .terminal-dots { display: flex; gap: 6px; }
  .dot-red { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ff5f56; }
  .dot-yellow { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ffbd2e; }
  .dot-green { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #27c93f; }
  .terminal-box pre { white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; }

  .copy-btn {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 4px 10px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    color: #fff; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .copy-btn:hover { background: var(--accent); color: #000; }
  .copy-btn.copied { background: var(--emerald); color: #000; }

  footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px 0 60px; }
  .home-btn {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 12px 30px;
    border-radius: 99px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.88rem;
    background: var(--panel-solid); color: var(--accent); border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }
  .home-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 10px 20px var(--accent-glow); }

  @media (max-width: 640px) { .drawer { max-width: 100%; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { * { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<canvas id="webCanvas"></canvas>

<header class="nav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a class="back-link" href="hazem_elhusseiny.html">→ العودة للرئيسية</a>
    <div class="toggle" id="themeToggle" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="تبديل الثيم">
      <div class="knob"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="wrap">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> INTERACTIVE_KNOWLEDGE_GRAPH // CLI_SHELL</div>
    <h1>خارطة الطريق التقنية <span>التفاعلية الكاملة</span></h1>
    <p>انقر على أي عقدة في الشبكة لعرض النبذة والمهارات — أو افتح أوامر التهيئة الجاهزة (Cisco / Linux / PowerShell / Huawei) داخل نافذة جانبية تفاعلية.</p>

    <div class="hint-badge">💡 انقر على أي كارت بالأسفل لفتح النافذة الجانبية — وحرّك الماوس فوق الخلفية لتفعيل الشبكة العنكبوتية</div>

    <div class="path-row">
      <span class="path-node" data-track="cli" style="color: var(--pink);">💻 CLI Shell</span>
      <span class="path-node" data-track="ccna" style="color: var(--purple);">📡 CCNA</span>
      <span class="path-node" data-track="ccnp" style="color: var(--accent);">🌐 CCNP</span>
      <span class="path-node" data-track="mcsa" style="color: var(--emerald);">🖥️ MCSA</span>
      <span class="path-node" data-track="security" style="color: var(--rose);">🛡️ Security</span>
      <span class="path-node" data-track="linux" style="color: var(--amber);">🐧 Linux</span>
      <span class="path-node" data-track="cloud" style="color: var(--cyan);">☁️ Cloud</span>
      <span class="path-node" data-track="automation" style="color: var(--orange);">🤖 Automation</span>
      <span class="path-node" data-track="wireless" style="color: #c026d3;">📶 Wireless</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main>

    <div id="cli" class="hud track" style="--tcolor: var(--pink);">
      <div class="track-head">
        <div class="track-icon">💻</div>
        <div class="track-titles">
          <h2>أوامر التشغيل والتهيئة الشبكية</h2>
          <span class="sub">CLI Command Center — Cisco, Linux, PowerShell &amp; Huawei</span>
        </div>
        <span class="track-badge">Level 00 — Essential</span>
      </div>
      <div class="topic-grid">
        <div class="topic-card js-topic" data-key="cmd-cisco-router"><div class="topic-info"><div class="topic-num">1</div><div class="topic-title">تهيئة راوتر سيسكو <span class="en">Cisco Router Config CLI</span></div></div><span class="click-icon">←</span></div>
        <div class="topic-card js-topic" data-key="cmd-cisco-switch"><div class="topic-info"><div class="topic-num">2</div><div class="topic-title">تهيئة سويتش سيسكو <span class="en">Cisco Switch &amp; VLANs CLI</span></div></div><span class="click-icon">←</span></div>
        <div class="topic-card js-topic" data-key="cmd-linux-term"><div class="topic-info"><div class="topic-num">3</div><div class="topic-title">أوامر تيرمنال لينكس <span class="en">Linux Terminal (Bash)</span></div></div><span class="click-icon">←</span></div>
        <div class="topic-card js-topic" data-key="cmd-powershell"><div class="topic-info"><div class="topic-num">4</div><div class="topic-title">أوامر باورشيل <span class="en">Windows PowerShell CLI</span></div></div><span class="click-icon">←</span></div>
        <div class="topic-card js-topic" data-key="cmd-huawei"><div class="topic-info"><div class="topic-num">5</div><div class="topic-title">أوامر هواوي <span class="en">Huawei VRP Commands</span></div></div><span class="click-icon">←</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="ccna" class="hud track" style="--tcolor: var(--purple);">
      <div class="track-head">
        <div class="track-icon">📡</div>
        <div class="track-titles"><h2>أساسيات الشبكات والربط</h2><span class="sub">CCNA — Cisco Certified Network Associate</span></div>
        <span class="track-badge">Level 01</span>
      </div>
      <div class="topic-grid">
        <div class="topic-card js-topic" data-key="ccna-1"><div class="topic-info"><div class="topic-num">1</div><div class="topic-title">أسس الشبكات <span class="en">Network Fundamentals</span></div></div><span class="click-icon">←</span></div>
        <div class="topic-card js-topic" data-key="ccna-2"><div class="topic-info"><div class="topic-num">2</div><div class="topic-title">الوصول للشبكة <span class="en">Network Access &amp; VLANs</span></div></div><span class="click-icon">←</span></div>
        <div class="topic-card js-topic" data-key="ccna-3"><div class="topic-info"><div class="topic-num">3</div><div class="topic-title">التوجيه <span class="en">IP Connectivity</span></div></div><span class="click-icon">←</span></div>
        <div class="topic-card js-topic" data-key="ccna-4"><div class="topic-info"><div class="topic-num">4</div><div class="topic-title">خدمات الـ IP <span class="en">IP Services</span></div></div><span class="click-icon">←</span></div>
        <div class="topic-card js-topic" data-key="ccna-5"><div class="topic-info"><div class="topic-num">5</div><div class="topic-title">أساسيات الأمن <span class="en">Security Fundamentals</span></div></div><span class="click-icon">←</span></div>
        <div class="topic-card js-topic" data-key="ccna-6"><div class="topic-info"><div class="topic-num">6</div><div class="topic-title">الأتمتة والبرمجة <span class="en">Automation Basics</span></div></div><span class="click-icon">←</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="ccnp" class="hud track" style="--tcolor: var(--accent);">
